{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiny Kings is the whimsical medieval base builder where your dreams of building and managing a pint-sized kingdom come true! On top of that, you get to dominate a siege of tiny pesky enemies... if you don't die first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Text_Build_English.png?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your kingdom on a procedurally generated hexagon world, 'cause who wants to build realistically when you can build on hexagons! By the way builders like their vacation time, so you'll have to wait a couple of days to build again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Build.gif?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Text_Manage_English.png?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be the compassionate, yet bossy, ruler and assign your tiny citizens tasks to keep your kingdom fed and fighting. Or don't. eating is overrated anyway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Manage.gif?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Text_Survive_English.png?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your precious little kingdom alive while all odds are against you! Yup, you guessed it, those pesky enemies are trying to take over your throne... again. Oh, don't forget about the changing seasons and possible arise of a crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Survive.gif?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards to show off your dominance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization so that your (puppet) king can look snazzy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Changing seasons and crisis for extra panic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural hexagon world to build a  tiny kingdom in</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3205460?t=1745336081","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745336081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/36eda607987ddf4438b9b1a90e72d2807014cd9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745336081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/36eda607987ddf4438b9b1a90e72d2807014cd9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745336081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiny Kings is the whimsical medieval base builder where your dreams of building and managing a pint-sized kingdom come true! On top of that, you get to dominate a siege of tiny pesky enemies... if you don't die first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Text_Build_English.png?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your kingdom on a procedurally generated hexagon world, 'cause who wants to build realistically when you can build on hexagons! By the way builders like their vacation time, so you'll have to wait a couple of days to build again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Build.gif?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Text_Manage_English.png?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be the compassionate, yet bossy, ruler and assign your tiny citizens tasks to keep your kingdom fed and fighting. Or don't. eating is overrated anyway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Manage.gif?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Text_Survive_English.png?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your precious little kingdom alive while all odds are against you! Yup, you guessed it, those pesky enemies are trying to take over your throne... again. Oh, don't forget about the changing seasons and possible arise of a crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/extras/Survive.gif?t=1745336081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards to show off your dominance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization so that your (puppet) king can look snazzy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Changing seasons and crisis for extra panic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural hexagon world to build a  tiny kingdom in</p></li></ul>","developers":["Floating Chicken Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/header.jpg?t=1745336081","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Tiny Kings","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> (untested)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> (untested)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Floating Chicken Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"17 Jun, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205460/c50ef8bab1e144e279e546c18ab510fd15077c48/ss_c50ef8bab1e144e279e546c18ab510fd15077c48.1920x1080.jp